Datasets
--------

This study uses the publicly released DAVIS 2017 and YouTube-VOS datasets.
No raw dataset footage is redistributed in this repository.

The separately released artefact bundle (release v1.5.1, saig_results.tgz)
contains videos derived from DAVIS 2017. DAVIS is released for research use;
the derived videos are redistributed for reproducibility only, and the dataset
licence continues to apply to any reuse of the underlying footage. The bundle is
not relicensed by the MIT licence of this repository.

